pos/neovim/neovim/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/deployments","created_at":"2014-01-31T13:39:22Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T09:22:08Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:17:45Z","git_url":"git://github.com/neovim/neovim.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:neovim/neovim.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim","homepage":"https://neovim.io","size":355316,"stargazers_count":94890,"watchers_count":94890,"language":"Vim Script","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":6465,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":2020,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["api","c","lua","neovim","nvim","text-editor","vim"],"visibility":"public","forks":6465,"open_issues":2020,"watchers":94890,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls/14891","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/14891","diff_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/14891.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/14891.patch","merged_at":"2021-12-15T15:18:06Z"},"body":"`refresh_scrollback` assumes pending scrollback rows exist only if the\r\nterminal window height decreased (or the screen was full).\r\n    \r\nHowever, after accumulating scrollback, it's possible in some cases for\r\nthe terminal height to increase before `refresh_scrollback` is called via\r\ninvalidation (especially when the terminal buffer isn't initially\r\ndisplayed in a window before `nvim_open_term`), which may crash.\r\n    \r\nAs we'll have enough room for some scrollback rows, just append them to\r\nthe top of the buffer until it fills the window, then continue with the\r\nprevious logic for any remaining scrollback rows if necessary.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCloses #14887?\r\nSeems to fix the issue, but I'm not sure if this is the best approach.\r\n\r\nThe mechanism for the crash was:\r\n\r\n1. Buffer created for the terminal isn't initially displayed in a window before it's given to `nvim_open_term`, so the size is misconfigured.\r\n  _`:h nvim_open_term` recommends showing the buffer in a properly configured window first._\r\n2. `terminal_check_size` sets a small terminal height (5 rows from the dummy window used by `aucmd_prepbuf` in `terminal_open`).\r\n3. `number` is changed, but the redraw logic in `win_update` (which also calls `terminal_check_size`) won't run until the next normal mode iteration.\r\n  _Seems that `foldcolumn` and `signcolumn` are redrawn differently, and don't call `terminal_check_size` when modified? 🤔_\r\n4. Lines are fed to the terminal, invalidating it. Due to its small size, there are pending scrollback lines.\r\n5. Terminal buffer is now displayed in the current window (it presumably has more than 5 rows 😄).\r\n6. The normal mode iteration occurs after the script has run.\r\n7. Redraw logic from changing `number` runs. It calls `terminal_check_size`, which sets the height of the terminal to that of the current window.\r\n8. Terminal `refresh_timer_cb` fires soon. `refresh_scrollback` is called too late, as the terminal height increased before refreshing the pending scrollback.\r\n9. Because there's pending scrollback, `refresh_scrollback` assumes the buffer has more rows than the terminal's height. Memline row indexing breaks. Crash.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/14891/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/14891/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":5473014344,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOAPphoM43Td_HzwAAAAFGN5JI","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/5473014344","actor":{"login":"seandewar","id":6256228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTYyMjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6256228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar","html_url":"https://github.com/seandewar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seandewar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-10-16T12:20:59Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"f9d0c4"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":5473014345,"node_id":"LE_lADOAPphoM43Td_HzwAAAAFGN5JJ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/events/5473014345","actor":{"login":"seandewa